{"ID":"20240206102057-hnczkrh","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206102057-hnczkrh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102057-hnczkrh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102112-owbaqc2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102107-yxtd0es\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102112-owbaqc2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"青果（橄榄）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903091041"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206102112-owbaqc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102112-owbaqc2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、海南、福建、台湾等地。\n【性状】\t鲜青果，呈梭状，两端钝圆，或渐尖，长可达34cm，粗约1.52cm。外表碧绿或黄绿色。时日较久者呈乌黄色、平滑、微带光泽。顶端有细小黑色的突起。基部有果柄痕迹。果肉颇厚实，内面黄白而多汁液。果核呈梭形，棕褐色，具6条梭线；质坚硬不易碎。核的横切面可见3个孔洞，其中各有一粒细长梭形的种子；种皮红棕色，种仁白色，油润，有香气、无臭，味涩微酸，嚼之有回甜。\n干青果；外形同上，外表棕褐色或紫棕色，皱缩，有多数凹凸不平的皱纹。果肉较薄，棕褐色或灰色，质坚韧，可与果核分离，内核性状与鲜者无异。味甜，酸涩味较差。\n干青果以个大肉厚、色灰绿、无乌黑斑者为佳。\n【性味】\t甘、酸，平。\n【功效】\t清热，利咽，生津，解毒。用于咽喉肿痛、咳嗽、烦渴、鱼蟹中毒等。"}]},{"ID":"20240206102107-yxtd0es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102107-yxtd0es","updated":"20240206102107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206102107-a65dhza.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729142619-uhk4uhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729142619-uhk4uhk","updated":"20240729142619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"橄榄 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/橄榄 7-20240729142619-uevr1zt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240903090919-l54qz4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903090919-l54qz4y","updated":"20240903090919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 481px;","style":"width: 471px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"橄榄 (17)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/橄榄 17-20240729150657-7qm56vi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 471px;\" parent-style=\"width: 481px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 293px;","style":"width: 283px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"橄榄 (18)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/橄榄 18-20240729150735-2d7x34b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 283px;\" parent-style=\"width: 293px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 290px;","style":"width: 280px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"橄榄 (19)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/橄榄 19-20240729150817-5ui103z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 280px;\" parent-style=\"width: 290px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240903090919-3xjmj2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903090919-3xjmj2d","updated":"20240903090919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 409px;","style":"width: 399px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"橄榄 (20)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/橄榄 20-20240729151838-fh1qr54.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 399px;\" parent-style=\"width: 409px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 404px;","style":"width: 394px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"橄榄 (21)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/橄榄 21-20240729151920-ppf1e02.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 394px;\" parent-style=\"width: 404px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 404px;","style":"width: 394px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"橄榄 (22)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/橄榄 22-20240729152025-x5ta4wo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 394px;\" parent-style=\"width: 404px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240903090919-3573io8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903090919-3573io8","updated":"20240903090919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 415px;","style":"width: 405px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"橄榄 (23)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/橄榄 23-20240729152130-h5iwkpf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 405px;\" parent-style=\"width: 415px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTex